 * Handles all gabarit source types: GABARIT, DOCUMENT_COURANT, DOCUMENT_PRECEDENT_CERTIFIE, DOCUMENT_SUIVI.
 * The fetched document paths are resolved using RunProperties pool path methods.
 */
